      "title": "How Nested Loaders Are Executed",
      "lectureOrder": 71,
      "videoOrder": 65,
      "sourceHash": "7db7c94537b684a2c71973b29d005ab2566a2f08e21335efbab8f4137238c333",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.19,
          "end": 4.56,
          "en": "Now, before we now start using that data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.56,
          "end": 8.34,
          "en": "to successfully update an expense,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.34,
          "end": 13.32,
          "en": "I want to get back to that loader in the $id route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.32,
          "end": 15.99,
          "en": "because there are a couple of important things",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.99,
          "end": 17.79,
          "en": "to understand about this loader,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.79,
          "end": 20.1,
          "en": "especially in combination with the loader",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.1,
          "end": 22.11,
          "en": "that we have in the expenses.jsx file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.11,
          "end": 24.45,
          "en": "that fetches all expenses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.45,
          "end": 27.48,
          "en": "Here, in this loader in the expenses.jsx file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.48,
          "end": 29.31,
          "en": "I wanna log something,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.31,
          "end": 32.13,
          "en": "and I'll log EXPENSES LOADER,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.13,
          "end": 34.713,
          "en": "so that we know when this loader executes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.82,
          "end": 38.97,
          "en": "In the id.jsx file, I'll also add a log",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.97,
          "end": 40.74,
          "en": "at the very beginning of the loader,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.74,
          "end": 42.84,
          "en": "where I'll say EXPENSE ID LOADER,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.84,
          "end": 45.453,
          "en": "so that we also see when that loader executes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.71,
          "end": 47.88,
          "en": "If I now save that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.88,
          "end": 50.94,
          "en": "and I increase the size of my terminal here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.94,
          "end": 54.33,
          "en": "and I go to just /expenses,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.33,
          "end": 58.89,
          "en": "I see that here, only the EXPENSES LOADER was executed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.89,
          "end": 60.393,
          "en": "which should make sense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.644,
          "end": 64.443,
          "en": "If I now click Edit here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.31,
          "end": 69.57,
          "en": "I see that the EXPENSE ID LOADER was executed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.57,
          "end": 70.59,
          "en": "which also makes sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.59,
          "end": 73.053,
          "en": "because I navigated to the Detail page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.4,
          "end": 76.83,
          "en": "If, however, I then reload this page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.83,
          "end": 78.78,
          "en": "so this Detail page here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.78,
          "end": 81.92699999999999,
          "en": "then I see that both the EXPENSES LOADER",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.92699999999999,
          "end": 84.303,
          "en": "and the EXPENSE ID LOADER executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 85.26,
          "end": 89.1,
          "en": "And I can also tell you that they will execute in parallel,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.1,
          "end": 91.05,
          "en": "so not after each other.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 91.05,
          "end": 93.42,
          "en": "Instead, to be as fast as possible,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 93.42,
          "end": 96.09,
          "en": "and serve a page as quickly as possible,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 96.09,
          "end": 100.729,
          "en": "Remix will call all nested loaders instead of sequential,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 100.729,
          "end": 105.214,
          "en": "so that loader of the nested id is called in parallel",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 105.214,
          "end": 109.22999999999999,
          "en": "with the loader of this expenses.jsx route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 109.22999999999999,
          "end": 112.02000000000001,
          "en": "which technically is a parent route to this id route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 112.02000000000001,
          "end": 114.453,
          "en": "because it includes this id route's component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 115.28999999999999,
          "end": 117.15,
          "en": "But they are called in parallel,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 117.15,
          "end": 121.14,
          "en": "and they are both called when we reload this page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 121.14,
          "end": 123.57,
          "en": "Now, both loaders must be called here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 123.57,
          "end": 125.28,
          "en": "if we reload this page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 125.28,
          "end": 127.56,
          "en": "because we need all expenses for that list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 127.56,
          "end": 129.03,
          "en": "which we see behind the scenes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 129.03,
          "end": 131.25,
          "en": "and which is there for a part of this page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 131.25,
          "end": 134.16,
          "en": "and we need the detail data for this modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 134.16,
          "end": 136.2,
          "en": "However, if you think about it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 136.2,
          "end": 139.35,
          "en": "the detail data for this expense is, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 139.35,
          "end": 142.62,
          "en": "already included in that list of all expenses,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 142.62,
          "end": 146.79,
          "en": "because the expense which we now loaded for this modal here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 146.79,
          "end": 148.92000000000002,
          "en": "is just one of all these expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 148.92000000000002,
          "end": 151.26,
          "en": "in that list behind the scenes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 151.26,
          "end": 153.39,
          "en": "So therefor, in this scenario,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 153.39,
          "end": 156.24,
          "en": "where we already fetched all expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 156.24,
          "end": 159.48,
          "en": "and all the data for all expenses in one route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 159.48,
          "end": 162.51,
          "en": "and we then need some detailed data in a nested route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 162.51,
          "end": 165.51,
          "en": "it's kind of redundant to have this extra loader.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 165.51,
          "end": 168.84,
          "en": "It just means an extra request to the database",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 168.84,
          "end": 170.913,
          "en": "and some extra time being wasted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 171.75,
          "end": 173.94,
          "en": "Instead of sending this extra request,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 173.94,
          "end": 176.61,
          "en": "we could simply use the data which we already have,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 176.61,
          "end": 179.67000000000002,
          "en": "which we did fetch in that loader of the parent route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 179.67000000000002,
          "end": 181.92,
          "en": "And that's what we'll do in the next lecture.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
